# Renderer

Target is `WebGPURenderer` + TSL. Do not tune against the WebGL2 fallback.

One world unit is one metre (`src/render-scale.ts`). Do not break scale locally for a shot.

Before inventing GPU architecture, read `.agents/skills/design-webgpu-solutions/SKILL.md`.

Capture mode stays deterministic: seed `0xe90c4`, frozen sim time, forced `day`, fixed cameras, UI hidden. Arrival beats and other motion must be inert under `body.capture-mode`.

Stylization must make adaptation or change-across-a-jump more legible. Descendants share a rig and palette. No fantasy variants. Restraint: every effect needs a stated purpose.
